// The rules of the versus stage's rounds (schema `versus_rounds`, owned by
// the app: rounds and victory are this stage's policy). A team loses a round
// when all its members are down; a simultaneous defeat is a draw. An edit
// here is played at the next start, with no Rust build.
(
    // Best of three.
    rounds_to_win: 2,
    // Long enough to see what happened, and short enough that nobody reaches
    // for the controller thinking the game froze.
    ko_hold_seconds: 2.0,
    // How long the match-over card stays up before the match resets.
    match_hold_seconds: 4.0,
    // Ticks, not seconds: the countdown is the one beat where "did both
    // machines start the round on the same tick" is the whole question. At
    // 60 Hz this is a second and a half.
    countdown_ticks: 90,
    // The last stretch reads FIGHT and not ROUND n: the first beat says which
    // round, the second says it is about to be yours.
    fight_call_ticks: 30,
)
